  "ratings": {
    "speed": 3,
    "complexity": 4,
    "interaction": 3,
    "resilience": 3,
    "pilot": 4
  },
  "strategy": "Doctor Doom gives a Villain menace and makes it connive at the start of every combat, and every discard that includes a land drains each opponent for 2, so the deck loots every turn and turns the discards into damage. Iron Monger grows every Villain whenever a creature connives, Ultron connives on each attack and makes Robot Villains, and Glorious Purpose stacks counters on each conniver until its sixth plan counter casts spells from the top four cards for free. Abomination, Chameleon and The Squadron Sinister come back from the graveyard for their mayhem cost the turn they are discarded, Madame Hydra and Endless Ranks of HYDRA fill the board with Villain tokens, and Kindred Dominance, Toxic Deluge and Blasphemous Act clear everyone else's. Stilt-Man, Klaw and Extract Power take the table's cards, while Kang Prime and Doom's Time Platform suspend spells for a free cast a few turns later.",
  "signature": [
    {
      "card_id": "doctor_doom_king_of_latveria",
      "why": "A Villain connives at every combat, and every discard with a land in it drains the table for 2."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "iron_monger_sadistic_tycoon",
      "why": "Every connive puts a +1/+1 counter on each Villain you control."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "the_squadron_sinister",
      "why": "Other Villains get +2/+2, flying and haste, and it comes back for its mayhem cost when you discard it."
    },
    {
      "card_id": "glorious_purpose",
      "why": "Grows every conniver, and its sixth plan counter casts spells from the top four cards for free."
    }
  ],
